Layer 5 — Infrastructure & Integration Layer 

Physical, digital, and biological substrate of the Mint-to Logic™ ecosystem

1 . Purpose

Layer 5 defines how the reflex logic becomes real infrastructure.
It fuses software, circuitry, and—where applicable—biological interfaces into a single, lawful substrate.
The goal is a network that executes Mint-Validate-Burn lifecycles natively in hardware or hybrid media without dependence on legacy GPU-AI stacks.

2 . Core Subsystems
