PCP Nodes (Process-Control Platforms)	Local reflex compute	Ultra-light micro-controllers or edge boxes that host Mint-to Logic™ instruction sets.	2025-07-17 § 2
Reflex Bus	Deterministic inter-node fabric	Low-latency data plane carrying ethical metadata between nodes.	2025-07-17 § 3
