4 . Integration Properties
Property	Effect
Substrate-agnostic	Same reflex firmware runs in digital, hardware, or bio-hybrid hosts.
Self-healing	Rest-to-Rise Protocol reconstructs state after node loss.
Deterministic Latency	Reflex Bus propagation in µs range; no stochastic model delay.
Security	Dual-hash + RBGA signatures prevent tampering.
Energy Efficiency	Reflex ASIC/FPGA < 1 W vs > 200 W GPU workloads.
AI-Optional	Agentic or large-model layers can plug in as optional cognition.
