6 . Deployment Cycle

Initialization → Install Mint-to Logic™ firmware on PCP nodes.

Governance Sync → Download RBGA™ policy tables & keys.

Operational Reflex → Nodes perform Mint-Validate-Burn locally.

Ledger Commit → Chronons recorded to CSML Fabric.

Economic Update → Shepherd Coin™ mint/burn via BYI scores.

Audit → Zero-knowledge proof bundles to regulators or custodians.

